10","kind":"update","title":"Update #12 - Steam Next Fest Is Almost Over! ⏳","summary":"Hey there!Steam Next Fest is coming to an end soon, but there's still time to try Rustmourne!If you haven't jumped into our sci-fi VR survival horror demo yet, now's a great chance to experience it for yourself. Just remember: watch your noise. Something might be listening. 👁️A huge thank you again to everyone who's played the demo, shared feedback, left a review, or supported our small indie team during the festival. It means a lot to us! ❤️🎮 Play the demo: We'd love to hear what you think! If ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T17:09:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040163","verified_at":"2026-10-24T21:01:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3775210-1847286114033574","game_id":"steam-3775210","kind":"update","title":"Update #11 - Demo Hotfix 1.1.7 (Is Now Live!)","summary":"Hello there!Another hotfix (1.1.7) is here! This update refines Gravchain aiming, improves movement, adds weight to heavier objects, and sharpens the game's visuals.We're continuing to improve Rustmourne based on your reviews and feedback, fixing issues and making adjustments wherever we can: keep the feedback coming! Patch NotesGravchain Aiming: Refined aiming to better reflect hand rotation.Object Weight: Added more weight and heft to heavier objects.Movement Improvements: Increased stamina ca","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T17:08:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033574","verified_at":"2026-10-22T20:03:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3775210-1847286114029867","game_id":"steam-3775210","kind":"update","title":"Update #10 - 50+ Reviews and an 88% Very Positive Rating!","summary":"Whoa!Rustmourne's demo has reached 50+ reviews on Steam and earned the Very Positive rating! 🎉We're thrilled to see so much support for our little sci-fi survival horror project. Every review, piece of feedback, and wishlist helps us improve the game and push Rustmourne further.Thank you for playing, sharing your thoughts, and helping us make Rustmourne better! We're listening, and we'll keep working to fix issues and improve the experience.🎮 Play the demo: We'd love to hear what you think! If y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:02:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029867","verified_at":"2026-10-21T22:16:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3775210-1846651706691610","game_id":"steam-3775210","kind":"update","title":"Update #9 - Rustmourne at the Steam Game Fest!","summary":"Heya there!Rustmourne is taking part in Steam Next Fest! 🎉🎉🎉Huge thanks to everyone that played the demo so far, and welcome to everyone new!🎮 Play the demo: 🎬 Watch the latest trailer: We'd love to hear what you think! If you play the demo, feel free to share your feedback and report any bugs you encounter. And if you enjoy Rustmourne, a Steam review would mean a lot to our small team. ❤️📝Feedback: https://steamcommunity.com/app/3775210/discussions/0/569300204759703991/🐞Bug reports: https://ste","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:09:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691610","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3775210-1846651706690426","game_id":"steam-3775210","kind":"update","title":"Update #8 - Demo Hotfix 1.1.4 (Is Now Live!)","summary":"Hola everyone!Version 1.1.4 is now live! This hotfix brings controller UI improvements, a potential fix for controller tracking issues, and further visual polish to Rustmourne.Give the update a try and let us know if you notice any improvements, especially when playing through Steam Link or Virtual Desktop! Your feedback helps us make Rustmourne a better experience for everyone.Patch NotesSteam Frame Controller Graphics: Added selectable Steam Frame controller graphics for the tutorial and menus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:10:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690426","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3775210-1846651706678679","game_id":"steam-3775210","kind":"update","title":"Update #7 - Public Demo & New Trailer!","summary":"Hello there!The Rustmourne demo is now live, alongside our brand-new trailer! 🔥🔥🔥Step into the derelict megastructure at the heart of our VR sci-fi survival horror game, face its hostile inhabitants, and discover what awaits you within. 🎮 Play the demo: 🎬 Watch the new trailer: If you'd like to support us, consider leaving a review for the demo, or wishlisting the game: If you have any suggestions, or if you encountered any bugs, please let us know here:📝Feedback: https://steamcommunity.com/app/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T17:06:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678679","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3775210-1845383656397476","game_id":"steam-3775210","kind":"update","title":"Update #6 - Playtesters wanted!","summary":"Hey there!Enough with trailers and videos... don't you want to try the game?!We are running a small closed playtest, first announced on our Discord, and a few slots are still open.You don't need to join us on Discord, but you will need to sign our Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA). To do so, you will need to a) disclose your identity (only for the sake of verifying who is signing, of course - not shared anywhere); and b) agree to confidentiality about what you will see and play. (For you to sign an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T19:58:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397476","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3775210-1842212951310875","game_id":"steam-3775210","kind":"update","title":"Update #5 - 20.000+ Wishlists & 120.000+ Trailer Views!🔥","summary":"Hello hello!Many, many thanks to the over 20.000 people who wishlisted Rustmourne on Steam! 🔥🔥🔥Also, our second trailer has collected over 120.000 views!These are incredible numbers for our small team - we are super happy with such a positive reaction.Many thanks to anyone who contributed by commenting, liking, and sharing the trailer and the game 🙇It really motivates us to work our hardest to give you the best game possible.How to stay in the loop?Wishlist and Follow on Steam of course! If you ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T17:01:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310875","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3775210-1840944183777661","game_id":"steam-3775210","kind":"update","title":"Update #4 - New Gameplay Trailer & Release Window","summary":"Hello!Rustmourne's second big trailer is out!With this trailer, we wanted to capture some moment-to-moment gameplay inside the megastructure where the game is set, and showcase some new enemies and weapons. What do you think?Also, big news! The game will release in early 2027.Here's the trailer:It’s the same trailer that’s on the Steam main page, but here you can see it in 4k.How to stay in the loop?Wishlist and Follow on Steam of course!If you want to chat, share feedback, or say “hi”, Discord ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T18:53:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183777661","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3775210-1840310314342447","game_id":"steam-3775210","kind":"update","title":"Update #3 - Upcoming New Trailer at the VR Games Showcase!","summary":"Hello!Rustmourne will be featured at the next VR Games Showcase next week!Expect a brand-new look at the game's gameplay, atmosphere, and world... plus some new details about what's ahead.Here's the announcement from the awesome guys at the VR Games Showcase: How to stay in the loop?Wishlist and Follow on Steam of course!If you want to chat, share feedback, or say “hi”, Discord is the place: https://discord.gg/78a2XjtbpsConsider also following our Twitter and/or Bluesky channels: https://x.com/r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T16:25:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342447","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3775210-1835871199299048","game_id":"steam-3775210","kind":"update","title":"Update #2 - 5.000+ Wishlists Goal Smashed! 🚀","summary":"Hello hello!5.000 and more thank-yous to each one of you who wishlisted Rustmourne on Steam already! 🚀Reactions to our Announce Trailer on social media have been amazing; we couldn’t be happier! Thank you to everyone who posted, shared, liked, and wishlisted our little game. 🙇🏻‍♂️To a bigger team, a similar milestone might not mean much, but to us, it’s really a strong signal that we are working in the right direction, and we can’t wait to show you more of what we have been putting together.How ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-16T23:34:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199299048","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3775210-1835236783564431","game_id":"steam-3775210","kind":"update","title":"Update #1 - Welcome to Rustmourne!","summary":"Hello and welcome! We just published our Steam page and we wanted to give you some more info about what to expect from Rustmourne. We take inspiration from Dead Space (clearly), Half-Life: Alyx and Doom 3. We are working hard to make a kickass game centered around atmosphere, vibes and tension. The game is a survival horror focused on exploration, stealth and a combat inspired by the strategic dismemberment of Dead Space, combined with Half-Life: Alyx’ immersive, VR-first physicality. Every weap","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T18:44:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783564431","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3775210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:41Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:40Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3775210":"2026-10-26T00:45:41Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3775210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5011020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:41Z","status":"ok","error_co